        "title": "GL Control: Official Website – Simple Support for Healthy Blood Sugar",
        "meta_descr": "GL Control is a blood sugar-controlling supplement manufactured by Maximum Edge Nutrition. It is specially formulated with a powerful combination of natural herbs, essential minerals, and scientifically researched nutrients designed to help support healthy blood glucose levels and overall metabolic wellness.",
        "header_custom": "",
        "footer_custom": "",
