        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#18356a\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Maintains Healthy Blood Sugar Levels: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">GL Control</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;is specifically designed to help maintain stable blood sugar levels throughout the day. By slowing the absorption of sugar into the bloodstream and supporting a better insulin response, it helps prevent sudden spikes and crashes. This balance plays a key role in reducing fatigue, mood swings, and unwanted cravings. Consistent blood sugar levels also support long-term health and help individuals maintain better control over their overall wellness and daily routine.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Natural Weight Management: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">One of the standout benefits of GL Control is its ability to support healthy and sustainable weight management. When blood sugar levels fluctuate, the body is more likely to store excess glucose as fat. This formula helps improve how carbohydrates are processed, reducing fat accumulation and encouraging the body to burn stored fat more efficiently. Over time, this can contribute to gradual weight loss while promoting a healthier body composition.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Boosts Daily Energy Levels: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">GL Control</span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;supports steady and reliable energy throughout the day by ensuring glucose is properly utilized by the body. Instead of experiencing sudden energy crashes after meals, users can enjoy consistent energy levels that help them stay active and productive. This improved energy flow not only enhances physical performance but also makes daily tasks easier to manage, contributing to a more active and balanced lifestyle.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Enhances Mental Clarity and Focus: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Balanced blood sugar levels are essential for optimal brain function. GL Control helps reduce fluctuations that often lead to brain fog and difficulty concentrating. By providing a steady energy supply to the brain, it supports improved mental clarity, sharper focus, and better cognitive performance. This benefit is especially valuable for individuals who need to remain alert, focused, and productive throughout demanding daily schedules.</span></li><li><b>Promotes Overall Metabolic Health:&nbsp; </b>In addition to blood sugar support, GL Control contributes to overall metabolic health. Its blend of essential nutrients, vitamins, and plant-based ingredients helps the body process nutrients more efficiently. This leads to improved digestion, better energy production, and enhanced cellular function. With consistent use, this comprehensive support can result in a more balanced metabolism and improved overall health and vitality.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "tB737Xejsa",
          "_anchor": "content8-12",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
